&lt;li&gt;Large-scale data engines like Apache Spark, Presto, and Kafka.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Functional programming languages including Clojure, ClojureScript, and the React ecosystem.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cloud-native infrastructure built with Kubernetes and Terraform, deployed across multiple cloud providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Machine learning models and systems including random forests, logistic regression, and probabilistic databases.&lt;/li&gt;
