&lt;p&gt;At Amperity, our Sales team plays a pivotal role in shaping the company’s growth and success. From identifying opportunities and building lasting relationships to delivering strategic solutions that address complex business challenges, you’ll help prospects and customers discover the value of our platform and achieve their goals. Whether your strengths are in new business development, pre-sales solutions consulting, operations, enablement, business value consulting, or strategic partnerships, you’ll collaborate closely with prospects and customers to create meaningful impact.&lt;/p&gt;
